From ff29f43973d0e9b5e3722946e32cf363d310d4aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scratch <scratch>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:12:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] RESEARCH (not for submission): refused second SCO connect
 with other parameters

Research cases for the CO-02 follow-up: a second connect() that is
refused while the first socket's connection exists, made with
BT_VOICE_TRANSPARENT (or BT_CODEC mSBC on data path 1), and the
parameters of every setup command and completion of the first link.
Legacy path by hiding Enhanced Setup Synchronous Connection from the
emulated controller.
---
 tools/sco-tester.c | 653 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 652 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

